/scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654956704_1792967072007468_1356553222514097416_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lNhtlxHwyGsQ7kNvwFyWeYe&_nc_oc=AdqgYL1yburtpDP6iT4kxCfUr1YvDIhiuUuVRcXJwNU0Ywoe91TtmO3AChroH_VyHpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVK8RXlbqjGCyrbcEiS9BcJm9UuErsIrHWwhLglVZMUcg&oe=6B0F0546"}, {"file_name": "04_dusklord_2560x1440.png", "id": "1167374645626261", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299745_1167374648959594_5025758032439875317_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p-puo3a6tEEQ7kNvwFw5UKL&_nc_oc=AdpnCgGzsHd0xp5gvJBZyTCMv9VyOWBpkuA9Olxs5ZZloR0XttpKoTzcwrypvWK70-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV_MVwp_M6qezImhOYLs-FYyq02W0dUzoGWdfQAP_fGNQ&oe=6B0F01AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1155807593863871", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294616_1155807597197204_666652266790470802_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iBE78GLs7iUQ7kNvwF6eKU1&_nc_oc=AdrPVp8vIGO40x2EbH1XpV8NsnzMXDTydQZC5rQXQkxDIHpj8Q-rvkUkMM9MjvbE6jQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW7Kyl_Aq6IHoCG14K9JMBkEuOt6l-W9dgnpaNyl01yCg&oe=6B0EEDA8"}, "display_name": "Arrowhold", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Arrowhold is tower defence with a real bow. A toy-sized valley rests on a table in front of you, your keep at its near edge and caves at the far end. Skeletons march out along the trails and you stop them before they reach the gate.\n\nHold the bow out in one hand. Take the string with the other, pull it back toward your face and let go. The further you draw, the further it flies; raise the bow to lob over walls and shields. A dotted arc shows where it will land, and headshots do double damage.\n\nFour worlds, forty levels:\n- Greenvale: grunts, runners, bone bats and the Bone Colossus.\n- Thornwood: shielded brutes, bomb bats, the Bat King and Thornback.\n- Frostpeak: wind that bends your arrows, and the Frost Warden.\n- Duskmire: crosswinds over the swamp, the Bog Hulk and the Dusk Lord.\n\nEvery boss you beat frees an archer to stand on your towers, each with a bow of their own: a fan of arrows, fire, a crossbow's knock-back, frost that slows, arrows that pierce. Caves break open mid-level, trails close and fliers dive at your walls. Spend your coins in the armoury on draw speed, damage, repairs, stronger walls and a longer sight, then take on Endless Siege for a place in your top 10.\n\nGrab the board to move, turn, tilt or resize it; the wave waits while you hold it. Your view never moves on its own. Play standing or seated, either hand on the bow, with a shorter draw if you like.\n\nNo account, no ads, no internet needed.", "short_description": "A whole valley sits on a table in front of you, and skeletons are marching on your keep. Hold a real bow in one hand, take the string with the other, draw and let fly. Lob arrows over shields, shoot bats out of the sky, free five archers to hold your towers and bring down six bosses across four worlds. 40 levels plus the endless siege."}]}, "developer_name": "Guidry Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://guidrygames.com/privacy.html#quest", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://guidrygames.com/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Guidry Games", "support_website_url": "https://guidrygames.com/support.html", "website_url": "https://guidrygames.com/games.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_c